    {
      "id": 119937,
      "name": "Pydro",
      "username": "Pydro",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-11-02T03:53:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>All of a hero’s cards, regardless of where they are, leave play when the hero is incapped. Cards played on a hero only leave play if the card specifically says “when the target leaves play, destroy this card.”</p>\n<p>As an example, Infections do not have that phrase, therefore they are not destroyed when a hero is incapped.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:53:16.514Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
