      "raw": "All of a hero's cards, regardless of where they are, leave play when the hero is incapped. Cards played on a hero only leave play if the card specifically says \"when the target leaves play, destroy this card.\"\r\n\r\nAs an example, Infections do not have that phrase, therefore they are not destroyed when a hero is incapped.",
