      "id": 119938,
      "name": "AlexxKay",
      "username": "AlexxKay",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-11-02T15:43:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Another useful general ruling is \"Cards underneath other cards do not have any txt or HP, but they *DO* have their backs.&nbsp; So, cards belonging to a Hero still belong to that Hero.&nbsp;</p><p>One interesting wrinkle to this is that anything that destroys Environment cards (especially ones that destroy \"all\" Env cards) can/must target Environment cards that have ended up under Haka's Savage Mana.&nbsp; Similarly, Tempest's Into The Stratosphere can pick any \"underneath\" cards and put them on top of the correct deck.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:53:16.591Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
