      "raw": "<p>Another useful general ruling is &quot;Cards underneath other cards do not have any txt or HP, but they *DO* have their backs.&nbsp; So, cards belonging to a Hero still belong to that Hero.&nbsp;</p><p>One interesting wrinkle to this is that anything that destroys Environment cards (especially ones that destroy &quot;all&quot; Env cards) can/must target Environment cards that have ended up under Haka&#39;s Savage Mana.&nbsp; Similarly, Tempest&#39;s Into The Stratosphere can pick any &quot;underneath&quot; cards and put them on top of the correct deck.</p>",
