      "created_at": "2014-11-05T20:38:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If the hero is already incapped when the Infection is played then they can't be Infected, but if they're already Infected and <span class=\"bbcode-i\">then</span> get incapped, then the Infectin sticks around until someone mangages to destroy it. This matters for Afflicted Frenzy, as PWatson just said, but also still counts toward Rat's flip mechanic.</p>",
