      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "If the hero is already incapped when the Infection is played then they can&#39;t be Infected, but if they&#39;re already Infected and [i]then[/i] get incapped, then the Infectin sticks around until someone mangages to destroy it. This matters for Afflicted Frenzy, as PWatson just said, but also still counts toward Rat&#39;s flip mechanic.\n",
